# Environment variables the tooling around this repository may read. The
# extension itself stores the user's Meta Model API key in VS Code's
# SecretStorage, never in a file, and never sets or forwards this variable.
#
# Optional, and yours to export in your own shell: the Muse Code CLI inherits
# META_API_KEY untouched and prefers it over its browser sign-in, as Meta
# documents. Leave it empty here; a real value never belongs in this repo.
META_API_KEY=
